WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.200
Availability: units across days: stays, rentals, seatings and departures; you see what's booked or free, and when.

2
00:00:10.747 --> 00:00:13.980
Move between days and look at the free slots.

3
00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:20.240
For a phone booking, click "New reservation" and set the unit, dates and guests.

4
00:00:20.794 --> 00:00:25.700
Click a reservation to "Confirm", "Check in", "Check out" or "Cancel".

5
00:00:26.248 --> 00:00:34.030
A reservation held for payment is released when its time runs out; if the customer is late, send the payment request again.
